hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2664","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Ma'mar al-Qaysi, narrated to us Muhammad—meaning Ibn Abi Bakr—narrated to us Ibn Jurayj, who informed me Abu'z-Zubayr, that he heard Jabir ibn 'Abdullah being asked about riding the sacrificial camel. He said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) say, \Ride it in a good manner if you are forced to do so until you find a mount.\""\n\n**CHAPTER:**"""""
